  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-050",
    "title": "灯火之外"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_335",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "沈砚秋捧着《太虚遗录》走入殿中：“天下已经乱过一次。乱的不是记忆，而是有人相信自己有权替所有人决定记忆。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "他们回到人间时，正下着一场很小的雨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8552,
          "end": 8552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雨落在荒原上，落在裂谷边缘，也落在那些从天穹缝隙中飘下来的记忆微光上。微光没有被雨水打灭，反而在水珠里折出七色，像有人把漫长岁月磨成了极细的尘。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8554,
          "end": 8554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在裂谷旁，怀中婴儿已经睡着。孩子掌心那枚无齿圆环时隐时现，每次亮起，远处便有一颗记忆微光落向大地。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8556,
          "end": 8556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一颗落在一名老农肩头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8558,
          "end": 8558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老农怔怔站了很久，忽然想起自己年轻时曾有一个弟弟。弟弟死在三十年前的旱灾里，家中所有人都以为他从未出生。老农坐在田埂上哭了一阵，随后起身，在屋后种下一棵树。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8560,
          "end": 8560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二颗落在一名正在赶路的少女手背。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8562,
          "end": 8562
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她想起自己曾经救过一只受伤的白鸟，白鸟后来飞去了哪里，她已经记不清。她却忽然决定不再跟随父亲安排的婚事，转身走进了城里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8564,
          "end": 8564
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "更多记忆微光落向人间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8566,
          "end": 8566
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "有些人接住了，有些人避开了。没有天庭替他们解释，也没有归墟盟替他们整理。每个人都必须自己面对那些突然归来的片段。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8568,
          "end": 8568
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这样真的好吗？”萧问蝉站在雨里问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8570,
          "end": 8570
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她已经不再穿白甲，手腕上的天庭金光也彻底消失。可她仍不习惯没有命令的日子，常常在清晨醒来，不知道今日该去追谁。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8572,
          "end": 8572
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把一柄新剑递给她：“先学会决定自己要做什么。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8574,
          "end": 8574
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果我做错呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8576,
          "end": 8576
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就承担。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8578,
          "end": 8578
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "萧问蝉握住剑，过了很久才点头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8580,
          "end": 8580
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字很难想？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8606,
          "end": 8606
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我想要一个不会被别人命令的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8608,
          "end": 8608
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋在册中记下：阿七，正在选择名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8610,
          "end": 8610
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "这句话写完，远处忽然传来钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8612,
          "end": 8612
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人同时抬头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8614,
          "end": 8614
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天上没有天门，也没有倒悬宫殿。钟声却从每一片云里传来，像人间本来就有一座看不见的钟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8616,
          "end": 8616
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临掌心的火线重新亮起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8618,
          "end": 8618
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它没有连接婴儿，而是指向东南方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8620,
          "end": 8620
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向他：“还有门？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8622,
          "end": 8622
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临闭目感知，点头：“不是门，是一段被留下的路。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8624,
          "end": 8624
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋翻开《太虚遗录》，空白页上自动浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8626,
          "end": 8626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天庭已失其名，归墟尚有余烬，玄霄宗等待归人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8628,
          "end": 8628
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站起身：“我们该回去了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8630,
          "end": 8630
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看着远处连绵山脉，想起自己初入玄霄宗时的雨夜。那时他只是一个没有完整过去的少年，以为修行便是不断向上，向着更高的门、更远的天。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8632,
          "end": 8632
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "如今他终于明白，真正的修行不是成为门里的东西，而是有一天能够站在门外，决定是否进去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8634,
          "end": 8634
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "婴儿在他怀中醒来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8636,
          "end": 8636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他低头，孩子正看着雨幕，掌心圆环发出微弱的光。那光里没有命令，没有预言，只有一片尚未被写下的空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8638,
          "end": 8638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“走吧。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8640,
          "end": 8640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "众人收拾行囊，沿着火线指引的方向离开裂谷。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8642,
          "end": 8642
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们走出很远后，陆照临回头看了一眼。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8644,
          "end": 8644
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雨中的木屋旁，沈砚秋正在给新来的村民倒茶。屋后那本被埋下的白骨书没有打开，泥土上却长出了一株细小的白花。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8646,
          "end": 8646
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "花瓣上没有名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8648,
          "end": 8648
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "但它在雨中活着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8650,
          "end": 8650
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "东南方的山路尽头，玄霄宗的山门仍在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8652,
          "end": 8652
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "山门上方，原本刻着宗门训言的石匾空了一角。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8654,
          "end": 8654
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临知道，那里等着他们写下最后一句话。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8656,
          "end": 8656
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "夜里，他们在一座废弃的驿站停下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8658,
          "end": 8658
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他比陆照临记忆中苍老许多，手边放着一柄断剑。殿中站着十余位长老，他们有人神情惶恐，有人愤怒，也有人将目光落在陆照临怀中的孩子身上，仿佛还想从婴儿身上看见一条能重新掌控天门的道路。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8754,
          "end": 8754
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你回来了。”叶青冥说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8756,
          "end": 8756
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我回来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8758,
          "end": 8758
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天门呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8760,
          "end": 8760
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8762,
          "end": 8762
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天庭呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8764,
          "end": 8764
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“失去了名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8766,
          "end": 8766
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "大殿内响起低低的议论。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8768,
          "end": 8768
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一名长老上前：“既然天庭已失其名，玄霄宗应当接管天下修士的记忆档案，重新建立秩序。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8770,
          "end": 8770
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冷笑：“你们刚从旧秩序里活下来，便已经准备成为新的天庭？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8772,
          "end": 8772
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "长老脸色难看：“没有统一记录，天下必乱。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8774,
          "end": 8774
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋捧着《太虚遗录》走入殿中：“天下已经乱过一次。乱的不是记忆，而是有人相信自己有权替所有人决定记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 8776,
          "end": 8776
        }
      }
    ],
